<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss March unemployment rate falls to 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss March unemployment rate falls to 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's unemployment rate stood at 5.6 percent in March, down from February's 5.7 percent, the Federal Office of Trade, Industry and Labour said.</p>
<p>				     March 1997  Feb 1997  March 1996</p>
<p> Pct of workforce unemployed    5.6	5.7	 4.6</p>
<p> Number of jobless		  202,207  206,291   165,305</p>
<p> Job vacancies			8,842    7,508     5,868</p>
</text>
